WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.501
This just in to CNN.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.237
Prosecutors in Fulton County, Georgia,

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.772
have granted immunity

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.874
to at least eight fake electors

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:08.675
in their probe

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.010
of Donald Trump's efforts

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.311
to overturn the 2020

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.079
presidential election.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.115
Let's get details from CNN's Sara Murray.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.516
Sara, what can you tell us?

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.250
Well, Wolf,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.852
we're learning this from a new court

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.254
filing that eight of the 16

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.322
Republican fake electors,

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.790
at least eight, have accepted

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.724
immunity deals

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:25.325
from District

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.459
Attorney Fani Willis

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.661
as part of her sprawling investigation

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.130
into efforts to overturn

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.531
the 2020 election

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.999
in the state of Georgia.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:33.933
Now, this is significant

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.401
because they are

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.503
relatively recent cooperators

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.370
as of April,

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.304
according to these court

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.773
filings and earlier

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:40.740
in this investigation,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.175
the district attorney had said

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.177
all 16 of these fake electors

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.112
were targeted as part of her probe.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.980
She made it clear

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.782
she was investigating this fake

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.983
elector scheme

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:50.550
putting forward

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.851
these fake slate of electors

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.253
to try to block

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.155
the certification of the 2020

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:56.890
presidential election results.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.425
So now she's got a handful

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.627
of new cooperators on her hands.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.395
This is part of the reason

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.563
that we have been told,

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:03.797
you know,

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:06.399
we saw this delay or rather an extension.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.067
And when she's actually

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.101
going to bring these charges

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.203
she recently informed law enforcement.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.604
She was likely to make an announcement

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:11.938
on who,

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:12.505
if anyone,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:13.206
she would charge

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.375
between July and September of this year.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.476
Previously we had heard

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:17.277
it could be a little bit

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:18.211
earlier than that.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:18.745
But look,

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.979
they're going to be getting information

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.014
from these cooperators.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.115
They're going to be sifting over that

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.283
and trying to decide

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.951
who, if anyone, to bring charges

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:25.885
against in this case.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:26.753
And the district attorney

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.188
had previously said

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:29.522
that some of these fake electors

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:29.989
were beginning

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:30.990
to turn on each other,

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.992
were beginning to incriminate each other.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.761
An attorney who represents these eight

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.930
who have accepted immunity deals and says

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.198
they're not turning on each other

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:38.965
they're not offering

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:39.933
incriminating evidence,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.800
but obviously

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.568
they have something

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:42.335
that the district attorney

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:43.369
wants enough to offer them

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.838
these immunity deals Wolf.

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:46.673
Good point. Sara Murray, stand by.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.941
I also want to bring in our senior

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.043
legal analyst, Elie Honig. Elie.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:50.910
What does it mean

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.279
practically for these fake electors

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.215
to now be granted immunity?

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.183
Right.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.085
Well, so immunity is a powerful tool

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.386
that prosecutors can use

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.122
to get at testimony from people

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:03.490
who may have been involved in a crime.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:04.757
There's really three steps.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.060
First, the prosecutor issues a subpoena

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.495
or request testimony.

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.930
Then the recipient of that claims,

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:11.631
the Fifth Amendment

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:12.632
says, I'm not going to testify

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:13.967
because it might incriminate me.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.802
And then the countermove by prosecutors

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:16.436
is to say,

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:17.003
okay,

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.671
we're not going to use your testimony

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.272
against you.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:20.173
You're immunized,

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:21.508
and now you have to testify

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.042
because you no longer have a Fifth

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.210
Amendment right.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:24.844
So, Sara,

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:25.345
how does this

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.580
fit into the broader investigation

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.681
in Georgia?

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:29.015
Well, look,

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:29.282
the fake

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.850
collector probe is one part of what

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:31.551
she's looking at.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:32.018
And obviously,

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:32.852
she's going to want to know

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.020
from these folks, you know,

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:34.854
what interaction

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.156
they may have had with higher levels

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.023
of the Trump campaign.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:37.357
About sort

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:39.125
of the organization of this plot.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.960
But they're also looking at, you know,

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:41.995
false testimony

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.863
given in front of Republican lawmakers

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:45.098
or given in front of lawmakers

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:45.899
in the state of Georgia

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.700
by people like Rudy Giuliani.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.869
They're looking at unauthorized access

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.137
to voting machines

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:52.872
or to election machines

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.574
in one rural county in Georgia.

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:54.974
And again,

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:55.308
of course,

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.676
they're looking at this phone call

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:57.810
that Donald Trump made

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.145
to Georgia, Secretary of State Brad

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:00.747
Raffensperger, as well as calls Trump

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.482
made to other Georgia officials

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:03.316
trying to pressure them

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:05.051
to overturn the election.

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.586
Ellie, does this tell you anything

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.921
about the prosecutors

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.189
strategy right now

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.623
and what type of charges

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.792
potentially the former President Trump

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.394
could potentially face?

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:16.996
Well, Wolf, it tells me that

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:17.964
prosecutors are trying

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:19.065
to climb the ladder here.

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.133
They're trying to use

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:20.934
the testimony

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.936
of these eight fake electors

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.571
to implicate the other fake electors.

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:25.004
But also,

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:26.139
I think you want to move up

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:26.973
the chain of command here.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.341
The main question I would have

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:28.975
for these folks

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.510
that they now have to answer is

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.078
who came up with this idea

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:33.746
and who coordinated it?

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:35.215
And now as to potential charges

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:36.216
as Sara laid out,

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:38.751
there are charges under the Georgia code

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:39.852
for attempting to interfere

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:40.453
with an election.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.521
But we've also had previous

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:42.922
reporting at CNN

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:44.123
that prosecutors are looking at

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.892
potential conspiracy charges,

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.227
which means one or more people,

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:48.328
two or more people

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.362
who come to an agreement

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:50.730
to commit a crime, or even,

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.864
according to our reporting,

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.099
racketeering charges,

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:53.800
which would mean

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.202
some organized group working together

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.770
to commit a series of crimes.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:58.104
And that's

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.372
consistent with Sara's reporting

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.273
just now.

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.040
Ellie Honig,

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.875
Sara Murray, guys, thank you very much.

